# Layout

Read `.cursor/skills/databricks-visual-language/layout.md`.

- Content width **1280px**. Hero padding **96–120px**.
- **Split hero**: copy left, large graphic right. Stack graphic below type under 1024px.
- Alternate oat/white bands with **one** navy product band, then light again, then navy footer. No two dark bands in a row.
- Product/why cards: graphic occupies the top of the card. Do not ship 3-up text-only tiles as the story.
- How-it-works is a navy stage + architecture diagram, not `Data → Propose → Approve` as the layout.
- One Lava CTA per viewport; pair with navy ghost. Sticky nav keeps the CTA when the menu collapses.

```html
<!-- ✅ -->
<div class="hero-split">
  <div class="hero-copy">…</div>
  <figure class="hero-visual">{svg}</figure>
</div>

<!-- ❌ -->
<section class="hero"><div class="hero-inner"><h1>…</h1></div></section>
```
